OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fat first in the evening but gradually
OL,7,Fclouding over from the south. Staying
OL,8,Fcloudy overnight with perhaps the odd
OL,9,Fspot of light rain. Strengthening
OL,10,Fsouth to southeast winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy and rather
OL,13,Fbreezy with some patchy light rain,
OL,14,Fbut some bright spells possible for
OL,15,FShetland. A chance of this rain
OL,16,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,17,Flater over Orkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
